elers-kelly-says-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:07:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 从乔布斯到詹森：科技的蜕变</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/5b10a0e6-aad6-403b-9f2e-23b5ca78897d</link><description>英伟达的传奇故事是关于硅谷政治转型的一个更大、更奇怪的故事的一部分&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/5b10a0e6-aad6-403b-9f2e-23b5ca78897d'&gt;从乔布斯到詹森：科技的蜕变&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：From Jobs to Jensen: tech’s metamorphosis&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/5b10a0e6-aad6-403b-9f2e-23b5ca78897d</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:10:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 感恩节游行重新安排后，游行乐队争相支付费用</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckd71ypy9e8eo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>纽约市的暴风雨天气促使组织者将梅西百货游行推迟两天，导致一些音乐家陷入困境。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckd71ypy9e8eo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;感恩节游行重新安排后，游行乐队争相支付费用&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Marching bands scramble to cover costs after Thanksgiving parade rearranged&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckd71ypy9e8eo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:15:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 约翰·辛普森：随着寒冷天气的到来，乌克兰已屈服，但仍未被打破</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3pw4yrr8kz9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>乌克兰即将迎来另一个毁灭性的冬天，但问题依然存在：这一切将如何结束？&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3pw4yrr8kz9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;约翰·辛普森：随着寒冷天气的到来，乌克兰已屈服，但仍未被打破&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：John Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but still unbroken as freezing weather sets in&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3pw4yrr8kz9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:18:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 降雨缓解了巴西主要大豆产区对厄尔尼诺现象的担忧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region</link><description>巴西顶级大豆产区深处一片生机勃勃、绿叶茂盛的绿色植物海洋，缓解了人们对厄尔尼诺现象会给世界顶级大豆生产国带来农作物损失的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region'&gt;降雨缓解了巴西主要大豆产区对厄尔尼诺现象的担忧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rains Ease El Niño Crop Fears in Brazil’s Top Soybean Region&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/rains-ease-el-nino-crop-fears-in-brazil-s-top-soybean-region</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 达纳·特尔西 (Dana Telsey) 表示，实体店在体验方面卷土重来</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/brick-and-mortar-making-a-comeback-says-dana-telsey-video</link><description>黑色星期五在东海岸的开局令人沮丧，因为暴风雨天气导致梅西百货感恩节游行推迟到凌晨，今年一些最大的面对面交易的排队人数也减少了。 Telsey Advisory Group 首席执行官 Dana Telsey 讨论了黑色星期五购物周末零售业的发展情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/brick-and-mortar-making-a-comeback-says-dana-telsey-video'&gt;达纳·特尔西 (Dana Telsey) 表示，实体店在体验方面卷土重来&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brick-and-Mortar Making a Comeback on Experience, Says Dana Telsey&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/brick-and-mortar-making-a-comeback-says-dana-telsey-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 共和党人欢呼的最高法院裁决最终伤害了他们</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/supreme-court-rulings-cheered-by-republicans-wound-up-hurting-them.html</link><description>关于投票权、移民和腐败的决定引起了强烈反对，从而刺激了投票率，推动民主党横扫国会。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/supreme-court-rulings-cheered-by-republicans-wound-up-hurting-them.html'&gt;共和党人欢呼的最高法院裁决最终伤害了他们&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Supreme Court Rulings Cheered by Republicans Wound Up Hurting Them&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/supreme-court-rulings-cheered-by-republicans-wound-up-hurting-them.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:47:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 在民主党与特朗普的较量中，输家可能是联邦承包商</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/politics/trump-congressional-investigations-contractors.html</link><description>即将上任的民主党多数派已开始在计划中的调查中针对企业和其他局外人，但总统威胁称，如果他们未经总统许可就遵守规定，将解雇他们。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/politics/trump-congressional-investigations-contractors.html'&gt;在民主党与特朗普的较量中，输家可能是联邦承包商&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：In Democrats vs. Trump, the Loser May Be Federal Contractors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/politics/trump-congressional-investigations-contractors.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:47:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNN] 普京最大的盟友质疑俄罗斯用来证明入侵乌克兰合理性的关键主张</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOcF9SRmlaWWFyaFgwWms1NTQ5UkVLdUxidVFzQms1Z09xMkRVRVVDNWhlVUVDQWhOd0Z4M3kyUUlob3IydGxEZWpJMU9uUnppZTl0RzdOQU9SSFVaM3RwemxtMFhGcWNJWjBDUnhjYWhPWmt5VW9jR3JIWjlBME83MG9sY3JjejFCQ1E?oc=5</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNN]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOcF9SRmlaWWFyaFgwWms1NTQ5UkVLdUxidVFzQms1Z09xMkRVRVVDNWhlVUVDQWhOd0Z4M3kyUUlob3IydGxEZWpJMU9uUnppZTl0RzdOQU9SSFVaM3RwemxtMFhGcWNJWjBDUnhjYWhPWmt5VW9jR